			"notes": "_hotfix: resized input for coordinates in /dia menu, also added color options, see https://github.com/TheTerrariaGuy/Just-Enough-Updates/commit/2e2494fff74e799a0973c0384ebf2c1b7370b16d_\n### New Features:\nPickaxe Ability Cooldown Display\nMining Waypoints Assistance: \n- /dia or /diamond to open waypoint menu\n- /addEtherwarp to add a waypoint for etherwarps (fades when close)\n- /addMining to add a waypoint for mining (invisible when bedrock)\n\nHeartbeat: pings the mod backend for user count (for website)\n\n### Upcoming features:\nVanguard Shaft Alert: alerts player for vanguard shafts\nRemaining Lapis Corpses Display\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/TheTerrariaGuy/Just-Enough-Updates/compare/v0.0.3...v0.0.4"
