			"notes": "This is the Just Enough Updates mod! I try to make features that I miss from 1.8.9.\n\n**Feature list:**\n- ctrl + click for copying chat messages\n- !ptme and !fx/!mx/!tx party commands (normal dungeons, master dungeons, kuudra, plug in tiers or floors for x)\n- party finder information for secrets & runs across all profiles\n\n\n**Upcoming Features:**\n- pet info HUD\n- glowing mushroom detector\n- mod menu\n\nUpdate: it seems the jar was 100mb because a library I was using is stupid, this one should be better.\n\n_note: the backend for this mod is slow on start up, so the first person (after 15 minutes of downtime) to poll api data will have ~30 second delay_\n\n_ps: i am new to minecraft modding, so there will probably be bugs_\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/TheTerrariaGuy/Just-Enough-Updates/commits/v0.0.0"
